{"id":"641834","name":"鸡腿拌西蓝花南瓜沙拉","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641834/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"三个"},{"name":"西蓝花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"南瓜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"15毫升"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"10毫升"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"5毫升"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"5毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜洗干净准备。","img":"images/641834/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"然后切块煮熟备用。","img":"images/641834/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西蓝花准备一些。","img":"images/641834/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切块入锅煮熟备用。","img":"images/641834/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡腿肉入锅煎，煎至两面偏黄。","img":"images/641834/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水，加入少许生抽，老抽，料酒，加入两个辣椒。","img":"images/641834/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入少许盐。","img":"images/641834/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧至大火收汁即可。","img":"images/641834/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"所有材料放一起，拌均匀吃。","img":"images/641834/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/641834/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"花了漂亮哦。","img":"images/641834/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}